love the drape.","primaryButtonText":"View Mekhla","primaryButtonUrl":"/category/mekhla-chador","secondaryButtonText":"Shop All","secondaryButtonUrl":"/shop","active":false,"order":7},{"desktopImage":"https://womaniabydola.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/IMG_4523-scaled.jpg","mobileImage":"https://womaniabydola.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/IMG_4523-scaled.jpg","imagePosition":"center 18%","thumbnailPosition":"center 24%","meta":"Handloom Sarees","stat":"Artisan Weaves","eyebrow":"Rooted in the Northeast","title":"Every thread tells a story.","description":"From our looms in the hills to your wardrobe — handloom treasures you can feel proud wearing.","primaryButtonText":"Shop Handloom","primaryButtonUrl":"/shop","secondaryButtonText":"Our Craft","secondaryButtonUrl":"/about-us","active":true,"order":8},{"desktopImage":"/hero/09.jpg","mobileImage":"/hero/09.jpg","imagePosition":"center 18%","meta":"Silk & Cotton Blends","stat":"Festive Collection","eyebrow":"Timeless Elegance","title":"Elegance that speaks softly.","description":"Refined handloom pieces for weddings, pujas, and the moments that deserve something truly special.","primaryButtonText":"Shop Festive","primaryButtonUrl":"/shop","secondaryButtonText":"Collections","secondaryButtonUrl":"/#collections","active":true,"order":9},{"desktopImage":"https://womaniabydola.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-02-at-10.06.20-AM-3-700x900.jpeg","mobileImage":"https://womaniabydola.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-02-at-10.06.20-AM-3-700x900.jpeg","imagePosition":"center 20%","meta":"Ethnic Wear","stat":"Kurta Collection","eyebrow":"Shop the Look","title":"Art you can wear.","description":"Vibrant kurta sets curated with love from Dola''s studio — colour, craft, and confidence in every stitch.","primaryButtonText":"Shop Kurtas","primaryButtonUrl":"/shop","secondaryButtonText":"Follow Us","secondaryButtonUrl":"/contact-us","active":true,"order":10}]', '2026-09-13T10:13:59.058Z');
